 'Here is the clear, well-formatted statement for the engineering problem shown in your screenshot:\n\n---\n\n### **📝 Problem Statement: Gearbox & Shaft Design**\n\nA motor drives an input shaft carrying a spur gear at a speed of **$1200\\text{ RPM}$** with a power input of **$15\\text{ kW}$**. The motor pinion (**Gear A**) has **$20\\text{ teeth}$** and meshes with a driven gear (**Gear B**) having **$60\\text{ teeth}$** mounted on an output shaft.\n\nAssuming a mechanical efficiency of **$100\\%$**, perform the following calculations:\n\n#### **1. Gear Analysis:**\n\n* Calculate the gear ratio ($i$).\n\n\n* Calculate the output speed ($\\text{RPM}_{\\text{out}}$) of Gear B.\n\n\n* Calculate the output torque ($T_{\\text{out}}$) available at the output shaft in $\\text{N}\\cdot\\text{m}$.\n\n\n\n#### **2. Shaft Analysis:**\n\n* If the output shaft transmits this output torque ($T_{\\text{out}}$) and is subjected to an equivalent bending moment of $M = 250\\text{ N}\\cdot\\text{m}$, calculate the minimum required shaft diameter ($d$) using the von Mises shear stress criterion.\n\n\n\n#### **3. Material Specification:**\n\n* The shaft is made of steel with an allowable shear stress ($\\tau_{\\text{allow}}$) of **$50\\text{ MPa}$**.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': None, 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'fc_0e5833e0-6450-4495-9666-44b75fb4055b', 'function': {'name': 'gear_design', 'arguments': '{"input_teeth": 20, "operation": "gear_ratio", "output_teeth": 60}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '3.0', 'tool_call_id': 'fc_0e5833e0-6450-4495-9666-44b75fb4055b'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7, 'tool_choice': {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'CalculationOutput'}}, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'CalculationOutput', 'description': '', 'parameters': {'properties': {'selected_tool': {'description': 'List of engineering tools used.', 'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'type': 'array'}, 'calculation_result': {'additionalProperties': True, 'description': 'Numerical outputs as exact raw floating-point values without rounding.', 'type': 'object'}, 'validation_result': {'additionalProperties': True, 'description': "Validation status and warnings. 'warnings' should include engineering context such as the type of quantity calculated, assumptions made, other stress/force components not accounted for, and conditions under which results are valid.", 'type': 'object'}, 'explanation': {'default': 'Detailed step-by-step engineering calculation process.', 'description': ' exaplain deeply and Comprehensive detailed explanation showing given parameters, formulas used, step-by-step substitution, and final results with physical meaning and write the reults with explaine and the unit for each result and make it human readable.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
